::MCR_U04_L06_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U04_L06_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.FL.12
Question:
Which response best supports this long-term planning skill: calculate monthly contributions over a year?
{
=A. Use contributions, time, growth, spreadsheet organization, and ending balance correctly.#Correct. Long-term planning compares repeated contributions, growth, and time with clear interpretation. 
~B. Look only at the first month.#Long-term planning needs repeated contributions and time. 
~C. Ignore growth and final balance.#Growth and ending balance are central to savings comparisons. 
~D. Treat estimates as guaranteed outcomes.#Growth models are useful estimates, but real results can vary. 
}


